  Northern Region: 2,310,928 people, 97.6 men per 100 women, median 18.2; The 2021 census's count for Northern Region.
  Oti Region: 719,010 people, 101.9 men per 100 women, median 19.2; The 2021 census's counts for Oti Region's districts other than Guan, added up. The census counts Oti Region at 747,248. Guan district was made in 2019 out of the Santrokofi, Akpafu, Likpe and Lolobi area of Hohoe Municipal and put in Oti Region; the boundary file still draws that area inside Hohoe Municipal, in Volta Region.
  Volta Region: 1,687,278 people, 91.3 men per 100 women, median 22.4; The 2021 census's counts for Volta Region's 18 districts and Guan, which the census counts in Oti Region, added up. The census counts Volta Region at 1,659,040. Guan district was made in 2019 out of the Santrokofi, Akpafu, Likpe and Lolobi area of Hohoe Municipal and put in Oti Region; the boundary file still draws that area inside Hohoe Municipal, in Volta Region.
